<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan &quot;buy&quot; on Ramco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan &quot;buy&quot; on Ramco.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration company Ramco Energy Plc was initiated as a &quot;buy&quot; at JP Morgan, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>JP Morgan said Ramco, which has a stake in a major oil field in Azerbaijan, and said the stock provided a means for investors to participate in the huge oil reserves in the former Soviet Union.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
